        <!-- Legend -->
        <mxCell id="legend" value="Legend  ━━ solid: primary flow  ┄┄ dashed: conditional / dependent / secondary  ◇ decision/gate  &#10;Color: GitHub-blue = PR-trigger workflows  GitHub-green = release-push workflows  GitHub-yellow = scheduled  GitHub-purple = manual dispatch  AWS-red = OIDC role / IAM  AWS-orange = AWS mutation outcome&#10;Security gates (red border): tfsec, Checkov, Trivy, gitleaks, OPA conftest, secret-scanning are BLOCKING — non-zero exit fails the PR check suite per ADR-006&#10;Source of truth: .github/workflows/*.yml + .github/scripts/validate_workflows.py (structural enforcement of OIDC + role-trust contract)&#10;Decisions: ADR-006 (CI/CD pipeline) — ADR-008 (RBAC + SigV4) — ADR-011 (agentic workflow contract, codifying pre-PR gates)" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;fontSize=10;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#5A6C7D;rounded=1;spacing=8;fontColor=#232F3E;" vertex="1" parent="1">
